   1189  f204							; Vertical movement — HERO-style jetpack physics
   1190  f204							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   1191  f204							; Gravity pulls down, holding Up fires jetpack (JetPower ramps with inertia).
   1192  f204							; Velocity is integrated through PlayerYSub and walked pixel-by-pixel via
   1193  f204							; StepDown/StepUp so collision stops flush at walls/doorways.
