   1302  f27f							; in $0100..$017F — a falling player's thrust was computed and then thrown
   1303  f27f							; away every frame (vy: $0180 -> $0188 -> $0158 -> clamped back to $0180), so
   1304  f27f							; the jet could not slow a fall at all. Compare the low byte when the high
