   2088  f600							; CEH_Key — type-6 key pickup (docs/feature_tiles_plan.md Phase 5): latch
   2089  f600							; KeyHeld ($A7 b7) and mark the key slot dead so it vanishes, with NO life
   2090  f600							; loss. X = EnemyIndex (set by CheckEnemyHit's hit path); reached via
   2091  f600							; `jmp CEH_Key` from that dispatch. Lives in the $F82C pre-pad pin gap
   2092  f600							; (177B slack before the $F8DD sprite pin); pre-pad END headroom is 1B but
   2093  f600							; this region is upstream of the pin, so it costs nothing at $FC67.
   2094  f600							; KEY is one per level, so KeyHeld is a single bit (no per-key storage).
   2095  f600							; LevelStartRoom b7 resets when LoadLevel rewrites $A7 (:1875) before its own
   2096  f600							; read at :1922, so no reader mask is needed; KeyHeld survives room changes
   2097  f600							; and normal deaths, resets on game-over reload.
   2098  f600							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   2099  f600				   CEH_Key
