   2150  f632				   SelectActiveObject
   2151  f632							; Tally / frozen scene (DropTarget = $FE): show the PLAYER and the MINER
   2152  f632							; only — no enemies, no raft, no bomb. That frame bypasses the overscan, so
   2153  f632							; RefreshEnemyY never runs while bank1's HUD writes $E0-$EF: EnemyRamY
   2154  f632							; ($E2-$E4) is left holding score-pointer bytes, and any enemy drawn then
   2155  f632							; jumps to a garbage Y (user report 2026-10-18: the raft "moved up to the
   2156  f632							; middle of the screen" the moment the points counting started).
