   2373  f759							; ==============================================================================
   2374  f759							; StageSlot1 MOVED to bank2 (the $FAC0 block) on 2026-10-22: the $F744 fill
   2375  f759							; is now the Phase 4/6 workspace and this body was its largest tenant (194 B).
   2376  f759							; The bank0 half is the split pad at $FBE5 (see the corridor pads), so the two
   2377  f759							; "jsr StageSlot1" call sites in SelectActiveObject above are unchanged.
   2378  f759							; StageSlot1B2 + PinSlot0 + the ObjSpriteOffTable copy all live in bank2 (the
   2379  f759							; enemy records are there, so the type read is a direct (FetchPtr),Y now).
