   3922  fe90							; FoldIndirect — cross-bank data fetch (HERO fold, write-triggered;
   3923  fe90							; level_bank_plan §0.1). Pad lands $FEF6-$FEFF (last byte ≤ $FEFF — $FF00
   3924  fe90							; stays the fineAdjust anchor). Bytes must be byte-identical in bank2
