   3926  fe90							; from the data bank at the same PC.
   3927  fe90							; Contract: bank select is ABSOLUTE $1FF8 (bank2) — X/Y both preserved,
   3928  fe90							; A = junk in, data out (`sta $1FF6` switches back, A preserved).
   3929  fe90							; P3.1 deviation (plan §0): `sta $1FF8,X` required X=0, but every enemy
   3930  fe90							; loop keeps the slot in X and has no free temp to swap (DEY/snake hold
   3931  fe90							; Temp live across the read). All level data is bank2, so X-selection is
   3932  fe90							; dead weight; bank3 data later needs a second entry `sta $1FF9` pad.
   3933  fe90							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
