   3936  fe90							; fetch ($FEF3) comes from bank2 = `jmp MothRoutine`. Neither bank runs its
   3937  fe90							; other half: bank0 is switched away at $FEF2, bank2 is never entered here.
   3938  fe90							; The 6-byte pad is the only free hole before FoldIndirect's pinned $FEF6.
